>  CellarScore: 40Moves: 42Mara uncoils her own measured rope and works its narrow end through the real trap-door seam. You lift from below until the wood takes some of the weight; she feeds the line across the hidden upper bar, catches it, and draws while you keep the door from dropping. The bar scrapes once across the floor above, then comes free.

The same trap door that locked behind you now stands open above the same stair. Mara recoils her rope herself. Up is physically possible again, but only because two people just did the work.
The thief attacks, and you fall back desperately.

